<title>USA: VEPCO president sets August 1 retirement.</title>
<headline>VEPCO president sets August 1 retirement.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virginia Electric &amp; Power Co said President and Chief Executive Officer James T. Rhodes plans to retire from the company on Aug. 1.</p>
<p>Rhodes became the Dominion Resources Inc subsidiary's top executive in 1989.</p>
<p>The utility said its board soon will begin the process of selecting a successor.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
